## WCAG 2.2 AA baseline

Target conformance: WCAG 2.2 Level AA for all new UI.

See also: `docs/accessibility.md`

## Requirements

- Semantic HTML (`nav`, `main`, `header`, `section`)
- All images have `alt`; decorative icons use `aria-hidden`
- Skip-to-content link as first focusable element — use `SkipLink` from `src/components/layout/skip-link.tsx` in `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx`; target `<main id="main-content">`
- `<html lang={locale} dir={dir}>` from locale config in `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx`
- Every input has `<Label htmlFor>` from `src/components/ui/label.tsx`; errors use `aria-invalid` + `aria-describedby`
- Focus visible: `focus-visible:ring-ring` with min 3px ring (see `src/styles/a11y.css`)
- Min touch target 24×24px (WCAG 2.2 SC 2.5.8)
- Use logical CSS only — see `i18n-rtl.mdc`

## Tooling

- `eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y` in CI
- `@storybook/addon-a11y` on all stories
- `@axe-core/playwright` for E2E a11y scans

## Testing

Run `pnpm test:a11y` and ensure Storybook stories pass axe with zero violations.
